## Interface: 20506
## Title: ArenaChillPrep
## Notes: Auto-trades crafted items (e.g. healthstones) to your partner during arena preparation on TBC Anniversary.
## Author: ArenaChillPrep
## Version: 0.1.0
## License: MIT
## SavedVariables: ArenaChillPrepDB
## DefaultState: enabled

# Load order matters: no libraries, so bootstrap first, then Data/Utils, then Classes.
# Every file receives the shared ACP table through the `...` vararg chain
# (each module file must end with `return ACP;`).

bootstrap.lua

Data/Constants.lua
Data/Items.lua
Data/DefaultSettings.lua
Data/Localization.lua

Utils/Tables.lua
Utils/Items.lua
Utils/Timers.lua

Classes/Events.lua
Classes/Settings.lua
Classes/ArenaPrep.lua
Classes/Inventory.lua
Classes/DeliveryController.lua
Classes/TradeManager.lua
Classes/OptionsUI.lua

# Unit tests run OUTSIDE the game (LuaJIT) — see Tests/run-tests.ps1.
# Nothing in Tests/ is loaded by the game.
